; THE SCABBARD MOUTH IS AN ANCHOR, NOT A PROP. The origin of this node and of
; the scabbard under it is the centre of the koiguchi; the anchor's +Y is the
; direction the blade travels to go home. IaidoDirector builds that basis from
; IaidoTuning at runtime, so this transform is only an editor preview.
;
; The scabbard is a CLOSED TUBE on purpose: the part of the blade that is inside
; is hidden by the scabbard's own walls, not by a `visible = false`.
[node name="CeremonyScabbard" type="MeshInstance3D" parent="CameraRig/LookPivot/MotionPivot/ShakePivot/WeaponRoot/SheathAnchor"]
